A||||51||firstfiero||Race a v tech honda....and learned the dangers of street racing!||||14||
Z||000000||firstfiero||07-28-2001||11:52 AM||||    Well is wasn't a close call but I could see how crap can happen. I pulled up next to a sweet civic si downtown. I've seen the kid around befor and know that he has a show winning car. Anyway Were kinda cruising side by side in traffic on the circuit. The cars in front of me and him kinda pulled away cause we were cruising slow...then in 2nd gear I put it to the floor to give the old fly by. By luck the cars in front of us turned off and he caught up to me. The passanger yelled out hey you want to go...I said hell ya and it was on. So we slowed down so we could catch a light. While we were waiting for it to change red he throws me a flyer him and his friends car mod business they just started up. I told him I don't like civics but I sure as hell like the vteck si's. He one of the rare si blue models with some sweet ass white rims and Altezza lights. No stickers at all. Anyway he hollered thanks and then started talking in one of those little motorola talk abouts. He looks at me and says it's all clear ahead we going? I said F*** ya were going. Light changed green and hammered it harder then I've ever done in the car. Perfect launch I emmediatly got a 2 car length on him. I know he has the faster car but I didn't screech my tires like he did! Anyway this is where it got hairy. As we round the slight bend in the street theirs a guy in a damn sedan backing up down the middle of a 2 lane street. He's drunk as hell and yelling at his friends at the bar. We both locked are tires up and came to a screeching stop. After cussing the guy out we cruised till we got to another light and this time he didn't screech his tires but I still got a car length jump on him. But when that vtech kicked in he reeled me in reeil fast. Damn they sound cool when they wind up!!!he went but I was able to keep my front end at about his back tire befor we had to shut down. Anyway I was just damn impressed with my girl that she kept up so well!! Sorry so long...just an interesting night I had to share!<P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||14
Z||000001||Indiana_resto_guy||07-28-2001||12:15 PM||||Street racing . . . . . . NOT a good idea.<BR>Step back and look at the possibilities, may not have been a drunk in the street but a family crossing and get run down. Now what?<BR>Pick up any local news paper from almost anywhere and read about related items of this happening. NOT fair to anyone who turns up being the victim, do you think?||||reg||13
Z||000002||Santa Cruzer||07-28-2001||12:36 PM||||hey first fiero what ever happend to<P>"hey Mr ricer come and tell me how your stickers make you faster"???<P>cool story man i agree street racing is risky and it make me feel like ****  after wards like ive hirt my car or somehtin ,just a thought i guess anyone else feel the same?<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000003||firstfiero||07-28-2001||01:03 PM||||   Still hate ricers. I can't stand someone who puts a type R sticker on their cavalier. I like japanese cars...Vteck civics kick ass! I also love s2000's ,supra's, mr2's and 300z's. The car I race last night was not rice. It was a kick ass racing machine. And yes I do feel bad after I put her through the paces. On the other hand thats what she was created for Right? <BR>   Oh and I took that off my sig. because agter my coumputer crashed for some reason it wasn't coming up right. MY computer crashing shouldn't have mattered I know but It wouldn't bring it up.<BR><P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||1
