Z||000045||Indiana_resto_guy||08-01-2001||11:49 AM||||OK, I laugh at the ignorance of the both of you who posted the last 2 posts.<P>****  happens, live with it? - - -How about ****  happens, live without it- - -in the instance of a friend, your girl friend, someones wife or child?   ****  happens, live with it? If that's the best you can come up with - - - stop trying<P>Shouting doesn't make me hear any better either.<BR>Being adult about it? Then be an adult and obey the law.<BR>One other point, through this entire post, not once did I call you any type of name, just how can you claim that your being adult about it?<P>Again, it's not you personally, it's the attitude shared by too many people. If somebody else made the same posting admitting to street racing, makes no difference, same result.<BR>People die every day by going '15 mph' over the speed limit.<P>You still have no right to select the fate of others just for fun.<P>I'm doing my best to be nice to you by giving you something to think about. Aparently what comes up you don't like and you stoop low enough to think that name calling will take care of it and hope to drag me to your level of thought.<BR>Not working. And never will.<P>Mr bad? Who's that? Your mommy?||||reg||1
Z||000046||DreXteR||08-01-2001||12:16 PM||||Well, here is my opinion. I bougth a fiero becuase its cute and have a lot of room for mods in all areas. Also its more sport than any civic or crx or almost any inmport (low cost). And the most important stuff, I bougth it to RUN IT FAST!!! Fistfiero is rigth, race in to the limits its fine taking precautions, also Indiana_resto_guy is rigth too- people can be injured. Maybe the age is a factor, youngsters are more risky and wnat some fun that old folks wont, but wtf- each 1 is resposible for him self. <P>I love my car and have a hard time fixing it, but that dont take my way to see things. I race with my Grand vitara from time to time. The last one was about 3 months, so as can be seen its not to race every day or looking to race someone every time going out. Anyway most of the accidents are by others and not from racers, I dont say racers are rigth or street race is good, just not always is their fault. In 1st place they should be racing in the street, but also a drunk driver shouldnt be either. <P>Just my opinion.<P>DreX||||reg||1
